
> The primary goal of this design is to build a purpose-built, Rust-based inference engine that achieves significantly higher throughput than existing solutions by leveraging tensor parallelism across two FirePro D700 GPUs to run the Gemma 4 12B model in Q4_0 quantization. It prioritizes performance optimization

